Description: Publish install progress to QML as the Execution singleton
 Adds io.calamares.ui Execution (progress, message, active, logVisible,
 toggleLog()). With a QML slideshow (API 2) the widget progress bar, status
 label and log toggle are hidden, so the slideshow and navigation panel draw
 the install step themselves.
Author: DOT OS project
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-14
